"DataOps\" data-description=\"old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory\" data-date=\"2026-05-07\" data-preview=\"old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory\"\u003eDataOps\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cinput checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"\u003e \u003ca href=\"/panicking-led-to-losing-my-desktop/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Panicking Led to Losing My Desktop\" data-description=\"I thought I had backups handled... can you imagine how the rest of this post is going to go with that intro?\" data-date=\"2026-05-13\" data-preview=\"I thought I had backups handled... can you imagine how the rest of this post is going to go with that intro?\"\u003ePanicking Led to Losing My Desktop\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003enote on \u003ca href=\"/blog-and-llm-knowledge-base/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Blog and LLM Knowledge Base\" data-description=\"Thinking about this tweet from Andrej Karpathy about LLM knowledge bases. I maintain a blog like this one at work, which is fairly well structured markdown...\" data-date=\"2026-05-13\" data-preview=\"Thinking about this tweet from Andrej Karpathy about LLM knowledge bases. I maintain a blog like this one at work, which is fairly well structured markdown...\"\u003eBlog and LLM Knowledge Base\u003c/a\u003e, should turn this into a plan\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003edoing it at work?\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"lost-but-potentially-recoverable\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eLost but potentially recoverable\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#lost-but-potentially-recoverable\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[[consider-the-point]]\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e[[self-hosting-a-code-forge-with-\u003ca href=\"/forgejo/\" class=\"glossary-term\" title=\"self-hosted code forge - codeberg - fork of gittea\"