ervice and is the first iteration of this idea\"\u003eNotifiq\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/soonish/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Soonish\" data-description=\"Personal events tracker dashboard\" data-date=\"2025-09-13\" data-preview=\"Personal events tracker dashboard\"\u003eSoonish\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/mindful/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Mindful\" data-description=\"Reminder and alarm app\" data-date=\"2025-12-26\" data-preview=\"Reminder and alarm app\"\u003eMindful\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/quadtask/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"QuadTask\" data-description=\"Eisenhower Matrix based task manager\" data-date=\"2025-06-13\" data-preview=\"Eisenhower Matrix based task manager\"\u003eQuadTask\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/qr-harbor/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"QR Harbor\" data-description=\"The QR side of Digital Harbor\" data-date=\"2025-12-26\" data-preview=\"The QR side of Digital Harbor\"\u003eQR Harbor\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"/cannalyze/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Cannalyze\" data-description=\"A self-hostable habit tracker with special attention given to gardening habits\" data-date=\"2025-12-27\" data-preview=\"A self-hostable habit tracker with special attention given to gardening habits\"\u003eCannalyze\u003c/a\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ejosh\u0026rsquo;s site redirects still, it isn\u0026rsquo;t his url so I still need to fix that\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"bugs\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eBUGS\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#bugs\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003erepoflow bug\u0026hellip; when my library is set to private, I can login and push from forgejo with my bot account. if I make the library public, then the push fails from forgejo with 401\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"runescape\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eRunescape\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#runescape\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cinput checked=\"\" disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://oldschool.runescape.wiki/w/Monkey_Madness_I\"\u003eMonkey Madness 1\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003epost on runelite plugins again\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003esafespot the gorillas in the temple\n\u003cimg src=\"https://cdn.statically.io/gh/pypeaday/images.pype.dev/main/blog-media/20251130112234_945c685a.png\" alt=\"20251130112234_945c685a.png\"\u003e\n\u003cimg src=\"https://cdn.statically.io/gh/pypeaday/images.pype.dev/main/blog-media/20251130122758_a8f58b1b.png\" alt=\"20251130122758_a8f58b1b.png\"\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cinput disabled=\"\" type=\"checkbox\"\u003e RTB Gnome quest\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ecan\u0026rsquo;t get ice gloves until 50 mining\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003egot the cake\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"migrating-my-homelab-stuff-to-a-mono-repo\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"heading-wear-glyph\"\u003eMigrating my homelab stuff to a mono repo\u003c/span\u003e \u003ca href=\"#migrating-my-homelab-stuff-to-a-mono-repo\" class=\"heading-anchor\"\u003e#\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://kanboard.paynepride.com/?controller=TaskViewController\u0026amp;action=show\u0026amp;task_id=247\u0026amp;project_id=8\"\u003ekanboard ticket for skm backup\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://kanboard.paynepride.com/task/109\"\u003ekanboard ticket for homelab mono migration\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul