      "content_text": "\nStarted on \u003ca href=\"/2025-07-16-notes/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"2025-07-16 Notes\" data-description=\"yesterday - 2025-07-15-notes\" data-date=\"2025-07-16\"\u003e2025-07-16 Notes\u003c/a\u003e using this page for my \"don't lose sight of the projects you're touching\"\n\n## Writing\n\n- [x] \u003ca href=\"/gods-zeal-for-justice-amont-men-displayed-in-the-divine-counsel/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"God\u0026#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel\" data-description=\"link to sermon\" data-date=\"2026-05-31\"\u003eGod\u0026#39;s Zeal for Justice Amont Men Displayed in the Divine Counsel\u003c/a\u003e\n- \u003ca href=\"/desktop-crash-2026/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Desktop Crash 2026\" data-description=\"Desktop crashed days ago, apparently my primary drive has been going bad for a while and eventually it just died.\" data-date=\"2026-04-22\"\u003eDesktop Crash 2026\u003c/a\u003e\n- \u003ca href=\"/desktop-setup-2026/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Desktop Setup 2026\" data-description=\"after desktop-crash-2026 I need to set new things up, I\u0026#39;ll track work here\" data-date=\"2026-04-26\"\u003eDesktop Setup 2026\u003c/a\u003e\n- \u003ca href=\"/dataops/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"DataOps\" data-description=\"old: using-restic-to-backup-my-home-directory\" data-date=\"2026-05-07\"\u003eDataOps\u003c/a\u003e\n- [x] \u003ca href=\"/panicking-led-to-losing-my-desktop/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Panicking Led to Losing My Desktop\" data-description=\"I thought I had backups handled... can you imagine how the rest of this post is going to go with that intro?\" data-date=\"2026-05-13\"\u003ePanicking Led to Losing My Desktop\u003c/a\u003e\n- note on \u003ca href=\"/blog-and-llm-knowledge-base/\" class=\"wikilink\" data-title=\"Blog and LLM Knowledge Base\" data-description=\"Thinking about this tweet from Andrej Karpathy about LLM knowledge bases. I maintain a blog like th